                                                "sense_id": "63fd65f2-e022-3cca-9635-3fb546d90b61",
                                                "text": "Customers may receive copies of a journal article, technical report, or paper from a conference proceeding upon request. Photocopying conforms to the U.S. Copyright law. If the document is not copyable, the original will be loaned to the customer."
